+Every room-level and UI branch that `economy-online` added or changed, one row each: where it is, the branch in one line, and the test that fails when the branch is deleted. It covers the hold grace (`inputGate.ts` and the room's hold reads), the supply crates (`supply.ts` and the room), the dockside shop and the tonic (`shop.ts`, the room, the simulation's step), the rumor changes carried from `intel-online` (`intel.ts`, the room), and the browser (`apps/web/src/shop.ts`, `pageKeys.ts`, `markers.ts`, `matchView.ts`, `seaScene.ts`, `main.ts`).
